 "_note": "Hand-written mechanics for Refit Bay parts, keyed by component id (passives) and card id (cards). Refit Bay text stays verbatim in data/components.json; this file only says how each effect plays. Rulings: Notion Components & Cards, 'Rulings for implementing every Refit Bay part' (Decided) and 'Phase 2 rulings to vet' (Proposed).",
 "_card_keys": {
  "play_mode": "'self' or 'attack', overriding the one derived from hits/statuses",
  "hit_chance": "chance each hit fires, by hit number; the last entry repeats (Logan's falloff: 100/90/70/40/20%)",
  "status_chance": "chance the card's statuses apply",
  "mult_if_target_status": "{status, mult, hardpoint_only}: damage multiplier if the targeted part has the status",
  "mult_if_target_below": "{fraction, mult, hardpoint_only}: damage multiplier if the targeted part is at or below that share of its HP",
  "on_hit_status": "{status, stacks, hardpoint_only}: put on the targeted part after the hits",
  "repeat_turns": "the attack repeats on the same part at the start of the attacker's next N turns (Logan)",
  "self_damage": "the card's damage lands on the part that played it (Self Splash, Logan: 'you take it all')",
  "hits_all_enemies": "every hit also lands on one living part (picked when the card is played) of every other enemy mech",
  "protocol": "a protocol effect; see scripts/combat/Protocols.gd",
  "volley": "presentation only: its hits land all but at once (a salvo of rockets, a shotgun blast), not one by one (Logan, 2026-09-30)"
 },
